note Exercism-style exercise "isogram": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/isogram
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note isisogram is true when no letter occurs twice in s, ignoring case; spaces and hyphens may repeat.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/isogram
om2
fn isisogram s view uchar * to bool
seen = new uchar 26 0
for i ulong len s
c = get s i
if and ge c 65 le c 90
c = add c 32
end
if and ge c 97 le c 122
k = ulong sub c 97
if ne get seen k 0
ret false
end
put seen k 1
end
end
ret true
end
